From: kershaw at unb.ca (John Kershaw)
Date: Mon, 02 Apr 2007 19:03:17 -0300
Subject: Re: calculating the z scores by apply function
In-Reply-To: <C8696843AE995F4EA4CDC3E2B83482A9018791E7@mailbox02.cshl.edu>
