Good morning,

I have a trivial question that's now very frustrating.  I want to use a 
text editor other than NotePad.  The editor happens to be called 
NotePad++ and it's in the directory c:\program files\notepad++.   
Whenever I change the editor option (or pager option) from the main 
menu, S+ wants to interpret any occurrence of a \n as a line break.  I 
can't get it to understand that it's a part of a name.  So, when I type

c:\\program files\\notepad++\\notepad++.exe

S+ sees

c:\program files\n
otepad++\
otepad.exe

and then says it can't find the file.  How do I tell it that \n is not 
