Douglas,
  You might consider using a pop-up window instead of using the Commands 
Window to read the password. Here's a short piece of code that should get 
you close:
getText <- function(Prompt = "Enter text", title = "") {
        ## return the text entered
        Control <- list()
        Control[[1]] <- editfield.control(label = Prompt, value = "", size 
= c(200, 10))
        Dbox <- dialogbox(title, controls = Control, buttons = "OK")
        retval <- dialogbox.display(Dbox)$values[[Prompt]]
        return(retval)
}

Just substitute the call to getText for readline.
Dave



