I think that colMeans(a*b, na.rm=TRUE)
would be sufficient (and efficient) for this problem.

The conformation rules ensure that each column of b gets multiplied by
the corresponding a elements and (a*b)[i,j] = a[i]*b[i,j]

  Andreas


