Hello Lawrence,

this is a scope problem.  To make "x" visible in your third example you
need to assign it to frame 1.  i.e.

lapply(c(1:2, 4:6), function(x) {
   assign("x", value = x, frame = 1)
   temp1 <- ...
})

Hope this helps,

