Gerald Jean got this sorted out with me, though it took a bit of additional tweaking.  The following code worked:

Lapply(c(1:2, 4:6), function(x)
	{
	assign("x", value = temp[,x], frame = 1)
	temp1 <- summary(lm(ckdepi6mo ~ x, data = temp))$fstatistic
	p <- 1 - pf(temp[1], temp[2], temp[3])
	c(names(temp)[x], p)
	}
)

My thanks to him.

Larry Hunsicker



