Yes. It was added to the package after the S-PLUS port was done.  The NEWS file says

  3.12   Add svyttest() for t-tests, as a wrapper for svyglm

>  How can I get it for S-Plus?

The easiest way is to use svyglm().   A linear regression model with a single binary predictor is the same as a t-test.

