2.     Help S+ and R users deploy their models and analyses in TIBCO
Spotfire applications, giving their customers self-service access to
modeling and statistics. This frees up S+ and R users to create new
analyses, rather than repeatedly running similar analyses in response to
end-user requests.

3.     Help organizations leverage TIBCO's middleware to make better
business decisions in real-time, based on statistical insights from S+
and R.

 

