supporters of R, as participants in R forums, supporters of the R
foundation, and sponsors of useR. This year I am on the Program
Committee for useR in July and we have a great program planned-I
encourage you to attend the conference.

 

Our most recent release (earlier this year) focused on integrating S+
and R into Spotfire. To do this, we enabled calling R from S+ Server
(renamed Spotfire Statistics Services), and integrated the server into
Spotfire. This makes it easy for someone to deploy an S+ or R script
through a Spotfire front end, making advanced analytical applications
available to a much wider audience (as Daniel mentioned in his posting).
For more information, check out our website
