>1. Pseudorandom numbers are also deterministic.
>
>2. To use a Halton sequence:
>
>x1<- (1:N - 0.5)/N
>w<- (1:N)*sqrt(2.)
>x2<- w - trunc(w)
>
>Now x1 and x2 are the 2-D quasirandom sequence you need.
>
