Thanks for all who replied and suggested using "attach" or "dump".

I used the detailed instructions below to convert the Linux workspace
to Windows.

I also needed to execute two more commands for transferring the
classes metadata:

objs <- objects(2, meta=1)
for (i in objs) assign(i, value=get(i, where=2, meta=1), where=1, meta=1)

There were some problems with methods named like "lBounds<-" which
