Try this. Subtract the years, call it y. Next, form the date that correspond
to your birthday this year. If you were born on a leapday, that date will be
NA, in which case form the date Feb. 28 of this year. If that date formed is
after today, you are y-1 years old. Otherwise, you are y years old.
Dan Murphy
